臺北市門牌位置數值資料 — 臺北市政府民政局 (Taipei City Government, Department of Civil Affairs).
Source: https://data.gov.tw/dataset/155472
Distribution: https://data.taipei/dataset/detail?id=b7c8e724-1e98-45ee-a0bd-f3840623ed97
Licence: Government Data Open Licence, version 1 (政府資料開放授權條款-第1版), https://data.gov.tw/license
This corpus samples and reformats the official address-point CSV, transforms projected coordinates to WGS84 and adds ASCII-digit forms. Floor queries retain published suffixes but test only the shared building point. Coverage is Taipei City, not all Taiwan. No people or household records are used.
District code names: 內政部國土測繪中心 (National Land Surveying and Mapping Center),
代碼服務－鄉鎮市區清單(戶政), Taipei response captured 2026-10-31 in taipei-districts.xml.
Source: https://data.gov.tw/dataset/102011
Distribution: https://api.nlsc.gov.tw/other/ListTown1/A
Government Data Open Licence, version 1 (政府資料開放授權條款-第1版), https://data.gov.tw/license
Changes: joined the address export's eight-digit district code to towncode and used townname
as the reverse district expectation. The XML capture is unmodified. No translated aliases are inferred.

臺南市門牌坐標資料-僅供參考 — 臺南市政府民政局 (Tainan City Government, Bureau of Civil Affairs),
2025 (民國114年), resource updated 2026-07-16; used in tests/registry/tw-tainan.jsonl.
Source: https://data.tainan.gov.tw/Resource/af44f904-2f4c-49b2-aaf8-1a64dce09bd4
This Open Data is made available under the Open Government Data License, version 1
(政府資料開放授權條款第一版), https://data.gov.tw/license. Users may use it when complying with
the licence's terms and attribution obligations.
Changes: sampled and reformatted the address-point CSV, converted TWD97 projected coordinates to
WGS84, expanded district codes and added ASCII-digit query forms. The manually placed points are
for reference only, not proof that a building or doorplate exists. This sample covers Tainan,
not all Taiwan. No people or household records are used.
District names: 臺南市政府研究發展考核委員會, 臺南市各區代碼 (updated 2025-07-25), under the same licence:
https://data.tainan.gov.tw/Resource/5b389f60-dee6-425a-8a40-f5cb2f949cf1
